                        "review": "I really wish I would have played through this sooner, I've had it for ages and I even remember liking what I had briefly played but it got buried in my backlog until now. This feels like video game comfort food as someone who loves not only rpgmaker games but rpgs as a whole. It is a no brainer, especially at the low entry cost! Fair warning though, the game gets pretty dark and deals with heavy subject matter that I won't elaborate on out of fear of spoiling it but do keep that in mind. Highly recommend!",
